.SH SETTINGS
Set with
.BR :set " in a configuration file or at the prompt."
.TP
.B automatically_count_files
Count the entries in directories for display.
.br
Type: boolean. Default: true.
.TP
.B autosave_bookmarks
Write bookmarks to disk as soon as they change.
.br
Type: boolean. Default: true.
.TP
.B autoupdate_cumulative_size
Keep recalculating directory sizes as they change.
.br
Type: boolean. Default: false.
.TP
.B bidi_support
Reorder right-to-left text for display.
.br
Type: boolean. Default: false.
.TP
.B binary_size_prefix
Use binary prefixes (KiB, MiB) instead of decimal ones.
.br
Type: boolean. Default: false.
.TP
.B cd_bookmarks
Offer bookmarks as completions for :cd.
.br
Type: boolean. Default: true.
.TP
.B cd_tab_case
Case sensitivity of :cd tab completion.
.br
Type: string. One of: sensitive, insensitive, smart. Default: sensitive.
.TP
.B cd_tab_fuzzy
Match :cd completions loosely rather than by prefix.
.br
Type: boolean. Default: false.
.TP
.B clear_filters_on_dir_change
Drop the active filter when entering another directory.
.br
Type: boolean. Default: false.
.TP
.B collapse_preview
Reclaim the preview column's width when there is nothing to preview.
.br
Type: boolean. Default: true.
.TP
.B colorscheme
Name of the colorscheme to use.
.br
Type: string. Default: default.
.TP
.B column_ratios
Relative widths of the miller columns.
.br
Type: integerlist. Default: 1,3,4.
.TP
.B confirm_on_delete
When to ask for confirmation before deleting.
.br
Type: string. One of: multiple, always, never. Default: multiple.
.TP
.B confirm_on_trash
When to ask for confirmation before moving to the trash.
.br
Type: string. One of: like_delete, multiple, always, never. Default: like_delete.
.TP
.B dirname_in_tabs
Show the directory name in each tab label.
.br
Type: boolean. Default: false.
.TP
.B display_free_space_in_status_bar
Show free space on the current filesystem in the status bar.
.br
Type: boolean. Default: true.
.TP
.B display_size_in_main_column
Show file sizes in the main column.
.br
Type: boolean. Default: true.
.TP
.B display_size_in_status_bar
Show the size of the selected file in the status bar.
.br
Type: boolean. Default: true.
.TP
.B display_tags_in_all_columns
Show tag markers in every column, not only the main one.
.br
Type: boolean. Default: true.
.TP
.B draw_borders
Which borders to draw around and between columns.
.br
Type: string. One of: none, both, outline, separators. Default: none.
.TP
.B draw_borders_multipane
Border style in multipane view. Falls back to draw_borders when unset.
.br
Type: string. One of: none, both, outline, separators, active-pane. Default: unset.
.TP
.B draw_progress_bar_in_status_bar
Overlay task progress on the status bar.
.br
Type: boolean. Default: true.
.TP
.B filter_dead_tabs_on_startup
Drop restored tabs whose path no longer exists.
.br
Type: boolean. Default: false.
.TP
.B flushinput
Discard input typed while a slow operation was running.
.br
Type: boolean. Default: true.
.TP
.B freeze_files
Stop re-reading file metadata, for use on very slow filesystems.
.br
Type: boolean. Default: false.
.TP
.B global_inode_type_filter
Restrict every directory to these inode types: any of d, f and l.
.br
Type: string. Default: .
.TP
.B hidden_filter
Regular expression matching names to hide.
.br
Type: string. Default: ^\e..
.TP
.B hint_collapse_threshold
Collapse the keybinding hint list once it exceeds this many entries.
.br
Type: integer. Default: 10.
.TP
.B hostname_in_titlebar
Show user@host in the title bar.
.br
Type: boolean. Default: true.
.TP
.B idle_delay
Milliseconds of inactivity before Canger stops polling.
.br
Type: integer. Default: 2000.
.TP
.B iterm2_font_height
Character cell height in pixels, for the iTerm2 protocol.
.br
Type: integer. Default: 11.
.TP
.B iterm2_font_width
Character cell width in pixels, for the iTerm2 protocol.
.br
Type: integer. Default: 8.
.TP
.B line_numbers
Line numbering mode in the main column.
.br
Type: string. One of: false, absolute, relative. Default: false.
.TP
.B max_console_history_size
Console history entries kept.
.br
Type: integer. Default: 50.
.TP
.B max_history_size
Directory history entries kept per tab.
.br
Type: integer. Default: 20.
.TP
.B metadata_deep_search
Search parent directories for metadata files.
.br
Type: boolean. Default: false.
.TP
.B mouse_enabled
Respond to mouse input.
.br
Type: boolean. Default: true.
.TP
.B nested_canger_warning
Warn when starting Canger inside a shell that Canger itself started.
.br
Type: string. One of: true, false, error. Default: true.
.TP
.B one_indexed
Number lines from 1 instead of 0.
.br
Type: boolean. Default: false.
.TP
.B open_all_images
Hand every image in the directory to the image viewer, not just the selected one.
.br
Type: boolean. Default: true.
.TP
.B padding_right
Leave a padding column on the right when there is no preview.
.br
Type: boolean. Default: true.
.TP
.B preview_directories
Preview the contents of the selected directory.
.br
Type: boolean. Default: true.
.TP
.B preview_files
Preview the selected file.
.br
Type: boolean. Default: true.
.TP
.B preview_images
Draw image previews using the terminal's graphics protocol.
.br
Type: boolean. Default: false.
.TP
.B preview_images_method
Which terminal image protocol to use.
.br
Type: string. One of: w3m, iterm2, terminology, sixel, urxvt, urxvt-full, kitty, ueberzug. Default: w3m.
.TP
.B preview_max_size
Skip previews for files larger than this many bytes. 0 means no limit.
.br
Type: integer. Default: 0.
.TP
.B preview_script
Path to the preview script. Defaults to scope.sh in the config directory.
.br
Type: string. Default: unset.
.TP
.B relative_current_zero
With relative line numbers, show 0 rather than the absolute number on the cursor line.
.br
Type: boolean. Default: false.
.TP
.B renumber_tabs_on_tab_close
Renumber tabs so they stay consecutive.
.br
Type: boolean. Default: false.
.TP
.B save_backtick_bookmark
Persist the previous-directory bookmark.
.br
Type: boolean. Default: true.
.TP
.B save_console_history
Persist console history between runs.
.br
Type: boolean. Default: true.
.TP
.B save_tabs_on_exit
Restore open tabs on the next run.
.br
Type: boolean. Default: false.
.TP
.B scroll_offset
Keep this many lines visible above and below the cursor.
.br
Type: integer. Default: 8.
.TP
.B shorten_title
How many directory components to keep in the terminal title. 0 disables shortening.
.br
Type: integer. Default: 3.
.TP
.B show_cursor
Leave the terminal's hardware cursor visible.
.br
Type: boolean. Default: false.
.TP
.B show_hidden
Show files the hidden filter would otherwise remove.
.br
Type: boolean. Default: false.
.TP
.B show_hidden_bookmarks
Include bookmarks pointing inside hidden directories.
.br
Type: boolean. Default: true.
.TP
.B show_selection_in_titlebar
Show the selected file's name in the title bar.
.br
Type: boolean. Default: true.
.TP
.B sixel_dithering
Dithering mode for SIXEL previews.
.br
Type: string. One of: None, Riemersma, FloydSteinberg. Default: FloydSteinberg.
.TP
.B size_in_bytes
Show exact byte counts instead of human-readable sizes.
.br
Type: boolean. Default: false.
.TP
.B sort
Which key to sort directory entries by.
.br
Type: string. One of: natural, basename, size, mtime, ctime, atime, random, type, extension. Default: natural.
.TP
.B sort_case_insensitive
Ignore case when sorting by name.
.br
